{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50220","headline":"过王濬墓（二首） 二 · 李休烈","name":"过王濬墓（二首） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"樵采徒爲禁，英威岂得从。\n定知[□]路蚁，（项疑阙字在「路」字下。\n）不畏水中龙。\n（[一]刘疑「虎」字。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李休烈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50220.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50220","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}